---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const entry = {
  "id": "harvard_ii1_239",
  "series": "Band II 1 (1663 - 1685)",
  "seq": 239,
  "text": "<p> [[744.1]] <b>211. JOHANN VAGETIUS AN LEIBNIZ</p>\n<p> [[744.2]] Hamburg, 14. (24.) August 1679. [200.218.]</b></p>\n<p> [[744.10]] Hamb. 14 Aug. 1679. </p>\n<p> [[744.11]] Cum sciam, primis tuis literis e vestigio fuisse a me responsum, quid responsoriis istis\n[[744.12]] actum sit, assequi divinando hactenus non possum. Vidit quidem illas tunc sola inscriptione\n[[744.13]] adhuc destitutas Dn. Lic. Placcius. Ad posteriores hactenus ut differretur responsio, effecit\n[[744.14]] consilium meum de visenda coram Hannovera, quod cum suis quibusdam impedimentis hactenus\n[[744.15]] redditum fuerit irritum, committendum nullo modo mihi fuit, ut diuturniore silentio\n[[744.16]] culpam ipsam contraherem, cujus nescio quis casus justam propemodum parere potuerat suspicionem.\n[[744.17]] Rudimentum simul prioris meae epistolae, quale forte fortuna inter schedas rejectaneas\n[[744.18]] adhuc reperio, visum fuit adjungere. Cui quod addendum sit, non puto esse aliud, quam\n[[744.19]] Typothetae tergiversationem, in lucrosiore opera occupati editionis hactenus dilatae causam\n[[744.20]] esse. Delibero ergo de alio alibi quaerendo, quod novae descriptionis et recensionis multis in\n[[744.21]] partibus requiret molestiam. Interim tamen in describendis schedis et recensendis nulla interponitur\n[[744.22]] mora, nisi quod morbus Bibliothecarii nostri cessationem duorum propemodum hebdomadum\n[[744.23]] amanuensi attulit. Videbunt, <i>si vita suppetet</i>, tandem, quae describi possunt, lucem,\n[[744.24]] si non possunt alio, saltem illo quo relicta sunt ab auctore, habitu. </p>\n<p> [[745.1]] Scientiarum compendia confecit etiam alia Jungius, quarum fragmenta apographa vidi,\n[[745.2]] autographas integras nondum sum nactus, est inter eas optica, et Trigonometria. </p>\n<p> [[745.3]] Demonstrationes Harmonicas parit sua sponte ipse libelli exemplis illustrati ordo. Extant\n[[745.4]] paucae in numeris a Jungio exhibitae. Addere omnes etiam alias mihi erat constitutum, si\n[[745.5]] obsequentem in editione nactus essem typothetam. Accedent si opus erit, et alia aliquando\n[[745.6]] parabitur editio. </p>\n",
  "number": "211.",
  "title": "JOHANN VAGETIUS AN LEIBNIZ",
  "date": "Hamburg, 14. (24.) August 1679. [200.218.]"
};
---

<Layout title={`${entry.title || entry.id} - Leibniz Writings`}>
  <article data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="entry-header">
      <h1 data-pagefind-meta="title">{entry.title || entry.id}</h1>

      <div class="entry-meta">
        {entry.date && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Date:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="date">{entry.date}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Series:</strong>
          <span data-pagefind-meta="series">{entry.series}</span>
        </div>

        {entry.number && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Number:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="number">{entry.number}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Sequence:</strong>
          <span>{entry.seq}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="entry-content" data-pagefind-meta="excerpt:211. JOHANN VAGETIUS AN LEIBNIZ Hamburg, 14. (24.) August 1679. [200.218.] Hamb. 14 Aug. 1679. Cum sciam, primis tuis literis e vestigio fuisse a me responsum, quid responsoriis istis actum sit, assequi divinando hactenus non possum. Vidit quidem illas tunc sola inscriptione adhuc destitutas Dn. Lic...">
      <div class="text-content">
        {entry.text.split('\n').map(paragraph =>
          paragraph.trim() && <p set:html={paragraph} />
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <nav class="entry-navigation">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Search</a>
  </nav>
</Layout>

<style>
  .entry-header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .entry-header h1 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .entry-meta {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .meta-item strong {
    color: var(--text);
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .meta-item span {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .entry-content {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .text-content {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 30px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .text-content :global(p) {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .text-content :global(p:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .text-content :global(b) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .entry-navigation {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .entry-meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>